  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India postharvest assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a partnership with Wageningen University (Stichting Wageningen Research). WU &amp; PA staff, will carry out an assessment of post-harvest options for strawberry, tomato &amp; mango. This will provide evidence for the development of India programmes and will allow us to test a post harvest assessment methodology, and develop it as a tool to improve the evidence basis of our work across PA. It also enables the development of a relationship with WU, a key organisation in the regen ag &amp; PUE space.</narrative>
  </description>
